	<li><b>Surface alaire :</b> 116&nbsp;m<sup>2</sup> (1,250&nbsp;sq&nbsp;ft)</li>
	<li><b>Poids</b><strong>&nbsp;à vide</strong>&nbsp;<b>:</b> 31,800&nbsp;kg (70,107&nbsp;lb)</li>
	<li><b>Poids maximum au décollage :</b> 56,500&nbsp;kg (124,561&nbsp;lb)</li>
	<li><b>Quantité carburant :</b> 18,400&nbsp;L (4,900&nbsp;US&nbsp;gal; 4,000&nbsp;imp&nbsp;gal)</li>
	<li><b>Motorisation :</b> 2 × Pratt &amp; Whitney JT8D-15, moteurs&nbsp;à&nbsp;double flux&nbsp;à&nbsp; faible taux de dilution, 69&nbsp;kN -&nbsp;7030 kg (15,500&nbsp;lbf) de poussée unitaire.</li>
</ul>

<p><span style=\"color:#333399;\">🛠&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:120%\"><b>Performances</b></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><b>Vitesse maximale :</b> 704&nbsp;km/h EAS (437&nbsp;mph, 380&nbsp;kn, M.85)&nbsp;jusqu\'à&nbsp;6,100&nbsp;m (20,000&nbsp;ft)</li>
	<li><b>Vitesse maximale :</b> Mach 0.85 (1041 km/h)&nbsp;à (et au dessus de) 6,100&nbsp;m (20,000&nbsp;ft)</li>
